{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f142e12acc5924334f9f326f3e97887d4dd836fe57a2762632d043053a29797", "ja": "（今日は仕事終わりに、前からやよいが\n気になっていたというネコカフェに行ってきた）", "zh": "（今天下班后，去了之前弥生一直很想去的猫咪咖啡馆）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "fc2b2d0f0339e30db0ed12001df45e63aded06415a23d8aba6aa83ffeecfd6b2", "ja": "ネコちゃんたち、かわいかったですねー！\nいっぱい撫でさせてもらっちゃいましたっ。", "zh": "猫咪们真可爱啊！\n还让我们摸了个够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1002_p", "source_sha256": "723c8d0b07bb2dfdfc4cc97043030bf05022f0c739430933e5f7a9cc708b3a7d", "ja": "やよい、ずいぶん懐かれてたよな。気づいたら\nたくさんのネコに囲まれててビックリしたよ。", "zh": "弥生，你还挺受猫咪欢迎的嘛。一回过神\n就发现你被好多猫给围住了，吓了我一跳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "f56dc70a349cc8177584df742c39719fdcce4ecd7d634a9fcd008677c0ede6bc", "ja": "私も驚いちゃいましたー！　ネコちゃんたち、\nみーんな私のお膝に乗ろうとしてくれて……。", "zh": "我也吓了一跳——！猫咪们全都想爬到我的膝盖上来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1004_p", "source_sha256": "87875f47726840c83cdd59d62e103e5259dd068d6e5ce01e31e81017fddd72c1", "ja": "やよいの膝争奪戦になってたもんな。それだけ\nみんな、やよいを気に入ったってことなんだろうけど。", "zh": "都快变成弥生膝盖争夺战了呢。不过这也说明\n大家都很喜欢弥生吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "d2fa4b51336bfb407c25d18e0fa8c0c1a690379f111168aef38ed2ed648af15d", "ja": "えへへっ♪　……あの、{$P$}。\n今日は誘ってくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪……那个，{$P$}。\n谢谢你今天邀请我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "1e778ec76a2b3d5f5083457bfd87fce85d49de6cf5eec3c936ab312f888dcf36", "ja": "雑誌で見てから、いつか行ってみたいなってずっと\n思ってたので……今日はすっごくうれしかったです！", "zh": "自从在杂志上看到之后，我就一直想着什么时候一定要去看看……所以今天真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1007_p", "source_sha256": "910bd346e2d7831ce3d39e08b941c9b5d175fee93ffc506937c56e2874ee49e7", "ja": "喜んでもらえてよかったよ。けどやよい、\nそんなにあのネコカフェに行きたかったんだな。", "zh": "你能开心真是太好了。不过弥生，\n原来你那么想去那家猫咪咖啡厅啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "2a6052da9829e744d2db6558041cb274705d83494aa6a398c0ed8fcb04351d58", "ja": "はい！　あ、でも……うれしかったのは、\nネコカフェに行けたってこともなんですけど……", "zh": "是的！啊，不过……让我开心的原因，也不只是能去猫咖啡馆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "d1aa7fadcd72f919b8a9321c8da0ce4ddc7bb5c608c2fd7baa581b917e8dd6ab", "ja": "私が、あのネコカフェが気になってるって話したこと、\nずっと覚えててくれたのもうれしかったんです！", "zh": "您一直记得我说过对那家猫咖啡馆感兴趣，这也让我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b8bcde34c240eeca0db76f6d95b606da796862e5ceba18d28fa325cd1a5a1642", "ja": "ああ、確かにやよいとネコカフェの話をしたのは、\n結構前のことだったっけな。", "zh": "啊，说起来，我之前确实和弥生聊过猫咖的事，那已经是挺久以前了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "16871b3bbb013bd115c5ee1948ba97ff2096e4d78e8de4e57ad903b9d85b270c", "ja": "はい。ちゃんと覚えててくれたのもそうですし、\n一緒に行こうって誘ってくれて……。", "zh": "是的。不仅还记得那么清楚，还邀请我一起去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "f50af87014bc497e5c423c8c7c339c3193a343cd8b900a0b58a14cbad6debf76", "ja": "やっぱり{$P$}は\n優しいなーって！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "果然{$P$}\n好温柔呀！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4dbb3a563aec99bce6cee94785cb2538f2dc75e820102a72d31e4fbf338e8637", "ja": "はは。ほんとはもっと早く連れていきたかったん\nだけど、なかなか機会がなくてな。", "zh": "哈哈，其实我本来想早点带你去的，只是一直没找到机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4197e2eb925b2dc02750ef0658b3cd6028c47f84a40ea6afaee8e0b2ce07fb48", "ja": "ずっと気になってたから、\n今回誘うチャンスがあって、俺も嬉しいよ。", "zh": "一直都很在意，所以这次有机会邀请你，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "5762ed4fd06ddd249f1e3414f267fd48099cf1eacdd9015b205d39651a17a795", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nえへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}……\n嘿嘿，谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "0a2fb6c0534b1df614d87f8cb232c2cbf4b8ade308d95b04351ff1868c68b900", "ja": "それで……。えっと、帰る前に、受け取って\nほしいものがあって。これ……。", "zh": "所以……那个，在回去之前，有样东西想请您收下。这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_1017", "source_sha256": "1a4eab6a97c32d833782e028ab7de6ba7c83abb59092f91701731b5f3f3cedd2", "ja": "手紙を受け取る", "zh": "收到信札", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_2000_005yay", "source_sha256": "88afbce559e4d593154349a688072431920605f65bb8f93ccf4e4bfb2e7f0732", "ja": "私のうれしいって気持ち、ありがとうって気持ち、\n上手に伝えられないって思って、お手紙を……。", "zh": "我觉得，自己开心的心情、感谢的心情，都没法好好传达，所以就写了封信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0364_2001_005yay", "source_sha256": "69bb9022f99dec0a5b6f25de000380fbd16cc72457e7a396ea5c35de59d69588", "ja": "私の気持ちをいーっぱい込めたので……読みにくい\nかもですけど、あとで読んでくださいっ。えへへっ♪", "zh": "我把满满的心意都写进去了……可能不太好读，不过请您之后再读哦。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
